            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2.11 Types of Angles and their Measures"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.528,
            0.885,
            0.62
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We have read about different types of angles in this chapter. We have seen that a straight angle is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 8 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and a right angle is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "9 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " . How can other types of angles — acute and obtuse — be described in terms of their degree measures?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.628,
            0.884,
            0.673
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Acute Angle:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Angles that are smaller than the right angle, i.e., less than "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "9 0 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and are greater than "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "0 ^ { \\circ } ,"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , are called "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "acute",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " angles."
            }
          ]
